# Lorehold Charm, second mode, an artifact card: Sol Ring (mana value 1) and Ornithopter (mana value 0, an artifact creature) are
# in Bot1's graveyard after Faithless Looting. First charm targets Sol Ring, which returns untapped. After that, a second
# Lorehold Charm targets Ornithopter and Bot2 exiles Ornithopter with Ghost Vacuum in response: the only target is illegal on
# resolution so the spell does nothing (CR 608.2b) and the Ornithopter stays in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Sol Ring
Ornithopter
Lorehold Charm
Lorehold Charm
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ghost Vacuum
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Sol Ring; Ornithopter)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ghost Vacuum.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lorehold Charm.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Return target artifact or creature card)
Bot1.Target(Sol Ring)
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Tapped = false
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lorehold Charm.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Return target artifact or creature card)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Activate(Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Sol Ring
Exile = Ornithopter
